      "key": [
        "Aksinya",
        "Court Jester"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Pavlina: Aksinya",
      "content": "Pavlina met the human Aksinya at a banquet in the Hesperides and showed her the manor's hidden courtyard of ice that never melts, saying that magic cannot truly endure. She gave Aksinya a silk flower. They later worked together in the Belyi Tsar's institute, but after the Cataclysm Pavlina, Koshchei and Alvis cast Aksinya into the Shadow Realm. Aksinya returned to stop Pavlina's ritual.\n\nAksinya says Pavlina taught her the traps of the house and calls her love too narrow; she also says she never hoped for her loss.",
