    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Larisa"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Pavlina",
        "Hesperides"
      ],
      "comment": "Pavlina: Larisa",
      "content": "Larisa was Pavlina's rival and friend, and a contender for Grand Duchess. She was more skilled in ceremony; Pavlina asked whether she lived for love alone, and Larisa said the greatest misfortune is to love no one. When the ancestor Yalyane Morevna decreed the Grand Duchess must have a soul, Larisa brought a human to marry him. He fled during the ritual and she died; Pavlina raced to the heart of the storm but found her dissolving into snow foam.\n\nPavlina swore on Larisa's sword that her own wedding would succeed and cites Larisa's death to justify taking Ikhor's power.",
      "constant": false,
      "vectorized": false,
      "selective": true,
      "selectiveLogic": 0,
