    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Ikhor",
        "wedding ritual",
        "Eye of Graeae fragment"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Pavlina"
      ],
      "comment": "Pavlina: Ikhor and the Wedding Ritual",
      "content": "The Eye of Graeae broke into fragments; one became Ikhor, who grants wishes. Pavlina holds a wedding ritual to draw his power and give the Snegovik souls; she shackles him with an icy collar. The ritual repeats because she is not whole and can take power only in portions.\n\nThe Traveler dreamed of the loop in which the clock strikes eight times and the wedding begins again. The final cycle ends at the Cloudborne Altar.",
