      "comment": "Pavlina: House of Hesperides",
      "content": "A thousand-year-old mountain manor held by the foremost Snegovik. Visitors once came with gold-etched invitations to feast; today it hosts Pavlina's ritual. It holds paintings, sculptures, puzzles and a courtyard shaped from Prime Ice.",
