      "comment": "Pavlina: Hvergelmir Years",
      "content": "Pavlina had a dedicated laboratory at the Pale Crown Palace and owned a cat named Lara. When she returned to the Hesperides she left a note asking Koshchei to feed Lara and warning him not to alchemize parts of other animals onto her.",
