      ],
      "comment": "Pavlina: Bell Ringing at Dusk",
      "content": "At the Cloudborne Altar the Traveler fights Pavlina; Aksinya joins as a Glaciomancer. Pavlina argues that the cycle of civilizations has ended, then loses, disintegrates and leaves behind a fragment of the Eye's body. Her last words question whether Aksinya let \"him\" choose.",
